@* Quiz kartı — Exams siyahısı və LessonDetail üçün. *@
<a href="/exams/@Quiz.Id" class="flex items-center gap-4 rounded-2xl border border-brand-090 bg-white p-4 shadow-[0_4px_15px_rgba(36,78,62,0.03)]">
    <div class="flex size-11 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-brand-083 text-brand-698"><Icon Name="clipboard-check" Class="size-5" /></div>
    <div class="min-w-0 flex-1">
        <p class="truncate text-[14px] font-semibold text-brand-776">@Quiz.Title</p>
        <p class="mt-0.5 text-[11px] text-sage-382">@Quiz.QuestionCount sual · @Quiz.DurationMinutes dəq</p>
    </div>
    <Icon Name="chevron-right" Class="size-4 text-sage-300" />
</a>
